# Serum presets and curves are compressed CBOR. With the diff driver enabled
# (`make git-setup`), git decodes them to JSON through `tools/serumfile.py dump`
# so `git diff` and `git log -p` show readable changes.
*.SerumPreset diff=serum
*.XferShape diff=serum

# Wavetables are raw audio; never diff or merge them as text.
*.wav binary
